# LANDER: level 1, one soft landing on the X1 pad; level 2 in the FOLLOW view, a crash,
# then a landing on the X4 pad on a ridge.
# Run: pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 2800 --script lander.script
# (from boards/desktop). LANDER starts at view STILL, steer STICK and 60 pictures a
# second; the script keeps all three. The game runs one physics tick a frame here.

# Home screen: five steps right, from BENCH to LANDER, then start it.
10 press right
12 release right
16 press right
18 release right
22 press right
24 release right
28 press right
30 release right
34 press right
36 release right
52 press south
54 release south
120 press plus            # START plays level 1
122 release plus
140 press south           # A skips the LEVEL 1 card
142 release south

# The craft starts high on the left, drifting right at 14 px/s.
300 press left            # lean left...
320 release left
320 press up              # ...and burn: the drift dies away (still at 360)
446 release up
446 press east            # B: back upright, over the X1 pad
470 release east
540 press up              # short burns to slow the fall
580 release up
660 press up              # frames 670-1010: the clip (the landing)
686 release up
700 trigger right 560     # a little over half power on the right trigger: the fall slows
760 trigger right 360     # just over a hover: a slow sink, 3 px/s at the pad
# 966: LANDED on X1 with a soft touch, the LANDED card (fuel left, SOFT TOUCH +25,
# pad, points 158).
980 trigger right 0

# Level 2 in the FOLLOW view: no burn at all, so the craft falls and breaks up.
1040 press south          # A: the next level, LEVEL 2
1042 release south
1070 press south          # A skips the card
1072 release south
1090 press minus          # SELECT: VIEW FOLLOW (the camera zooms in near the ground)
1092 release minus
# 1416: CRASHED, TOO FAST.

# The same level again: a hover past a ridge, a stop, and a landing on its X4 pad.
1560 press south          # A: TRY AGAIN, the LEVEL 2 card
1562 release south
1590 press south          # A skips the card
1592 release south
1760 trigger right 1023   # full power for a second...
1820 trigger right 420    # ...then a little over a hover: the craft drifts right low over the hills
2152 press left           # lean left...
2172 release left
2172 trigger right 1023   # ...and burn: the drift dies away beside the ridge
2262 trigger right 420
2262 press east           # B: back upright, over the X4 pad
2286 release east
2312 trigger right 0      # let it fall a little
2462 trigger right 384    # about a hover: a steady sink
# 2575: LANDED on X4.
